@Edip.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7xxx
@ApiKey = edip-dev-api-key

### Health
GET {{Edip.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### List data sources
GET {{Edip.Api_HostAddress}}/api/datasources
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Validate data source
POST {{Edip.Api_HostAddress}}/api/datasources/AAAAAAAA-AAAA-AAAA-AAAA-AAAAAAAAAAAA/validate
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Refresh metadata
POST {{Edip.Api_HostAddress}}/api/metadata/refresh/AAAAAAAA-AAAA-AAAA-AAAA-AAAAAAAAAAAA
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Execute job
POST {{Edip.Api_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/CCCCCCCC-CCCC-CCCC-CCCC-CCCCCCCCCCCC/execute
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Export health report
GET {{Edip.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/datasource-health/export?format=xlsx
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
